    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "63216d12-e055-42e4-9842-af106d06e25c",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Taking Back What&apos;s Mine",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102076087583",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 64c391f7-4765-48b6-96bc-df8aa5a4186b).Image",
        "Description": "“They keep stealing my spotlight! Every single one of them. I want them gone. Sato and Mathias especially. make their deaths brutal. They deserve it! And don&apos;t come looking for me! You do the job, you get paid, and that&apos;s it. Don&apos;t find me, don&apos;t talk to me, don&apos;t even try. I&apos;ll be somewhere safe. Very safe. Just do your job and leave me alone. Please.”\r\rThe client insists this is “strictly professional.” We remain unconvinced.",
